    "Name": "Dagoth DG-P-7b",
    "Details": "Periphery armorers loved the DG-P-7 but cursed its Gauss rifle, whose ammunition proved scarce out in the sticks. The DG-P-7b refit fixes this by replacing the Gauss with a pair of common AC/5s feeding off plentiful standard rounds. The LRM-10 and twin Large Lasers remain, but the shield was dropped to reduce costs further as its repeated repairs proved too costly.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Well Balanced</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.15</color></b>",
